00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.417
ALEXIS MOUSSINE-POUCHKINE:
Can you

00:00:01.417 --> 00:00:03.030
get a sense of
Google Cloud Platform

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.645
machine-learning products
in just a few minutes?

00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:06.270
Let's find out.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:09.114
